{
  "format": "vegan tree_props presets",
  "notes": [
    "Each \"props\" object has all 41 tree_props fields, named and ordered exactly as the C++ struct in tree_system.cpp (and TREE_PROP_NAMES in tests.js), so it can be assigned straight onto the tree props object: for (k in props) tree[k] = props[k]; tree.needs_update = true.",
    "Units: 1 unit ~ 1 m. The coast redwood is scaled down, and all values stay inside the tests.js slider ranges. The stored seed is a typical-looking one; other seeds give natural variation (see generated.height_over_seeds_1_to_12) because lengthJitter, radiusJitter, azimuthJitter and elevationJitter are non-zero.",
    "leaf_texture is the id to pass to leaf_textures.create()/pixels() (leaf_textures.js): twig cards are alpha-cut leaf textures and tree_generate colours them with the bark colour, so draw them with a material that does not use vertex colour. Requires the 41-prop tree_system.cpp (the four jitter props are the last four fields); set them to 0 for the old, regular branching."
  ],
